php-pinba (1.2.0-1~noble1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging for the fork.
  * Build the pinba extension for PHP 8.2, 8.3, 8.4 and 8.5 as separate
    php<version>-pinba binary packages.
  * Install the extension into each PHP extension_dir and ship a
    mods-available/pinba.ini enabled via phpenmod.

